{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:29:24+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voyagers", "steam_appid": 1155800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155800/extras/f4295486468fc04b9148d795030dc9b8.avif?t=1574658192\" width=640 height=150 /></span><br><br>Voyagers is a simplistic strategy game/city builder about building your own sci-fi metropolis on exotic planets. Starting out as a mere colony you'll grow into a striving city.<br>Travel to an endless amount of planets with and construct a variety of colonies to creatively fulfill your vision of a Utopian or Dystopian city.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155800/extras/1106344930f06cda9a5652b189e33194.avif?t=1574658192\" width=640 height=150 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An infinite amount of procedurally generated planets that offer new challenges, play-styles, and faunas<br></li><li> Immersive and relaxing atmosphere<br></li><li> A Great number of buildings, decorations, and planets to fully live out your creativity<br></li><li> Accessible, simple and stress-free gameplay</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155800/extras/ba4bcabf2e94bc091d9e121419a90519.poster.avif?t=1574658192\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155800/extras/ba4bcabf2e94bc091d9e121419a90519.webm?t=1574658192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155800/extras/ba4bcabf2e94bc091d9e121419a90519.mp4?t=1574658192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br